{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Shell and faces / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n20 system members · 15 one-hop ghost neighbours · 39 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"task-asset-read","type":"text","x":2784,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**asset-read task**\nReads asset files from SD off the UI thread…\n\nruns: prio 1. On demand from the orrery card poll.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Rendering pipeline|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"eng-screen-stack","type":"text","x":1872,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Screen stack and transitions**\n8-deep push/pop/replace/home stack with…\n\nruns: Driven from frame_run; no task of its own.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Engine and scheduling|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"eng-settings-shutter","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Settings shutter blur helper**\nBlur helper used for the Settings list…\n\nruns: UI task while Settings opens.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Shell and faces|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"eng-app-registry","type":"text","x":2784,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**App registry and boot**\nStatic table of 28 launcher entries,…\n\nruns: Library code on the UI task.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Shell and faces|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"eng-orrery-shade","type":"text","x":3240,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Orrery Q16 shade table and card shade**\nQ16 lighting multipliers (512 entries) and…\n\nruns: dotbake at boot; read during orrery render.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 4 - Uncovered built files- blur pipeline, orrery shade, fonts|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"eng-ephem","type":"text","x":3696,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Ephemeris (core/ephem.c)**\nPlanet and Sun positions from the Julian…\n\nruns: UI task each orrery frame.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Utility apps|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-heart","type":"text","x":2100,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Heart aggregation service**\nCombines the live locked reading, the…\n\nruns: heart_tick every 60 s on the UI task.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-system","type":"text","x":2556,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**System status service (svc_sys)**\nMirrors battery percent/charging/rail, phone…\n\nruns: sys_tick 1 Hz.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Power and battery|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-activity","type":"text","x":3012,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Activity service (svc_activity)**\nTurns pedometer output into daily steps, km,…\n\nruns: act_tick 1 Hz on the UI task, also screen off. Checkpoint every 10 min when dirty.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-prefs","type":"text","x":3468,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Preferences service (nos_prefs)**\nOwns the 52 B nos_prefs struct, defaults,…\n\nruns: prefs_tick on the UI task, only when the persistence window is open.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"store-sd-sky","type":"text","x":2556,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":248,"text":"**SD orrery textures (/sky)**\n/sdcard/sky/*.565 and *.rgba planet textures…\n\nruns: SD. Read on demand.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Shell and faces|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
