{"id":"sys-home","type":"text","x":2328,"y":3356,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Home pager**\nRoot screen: horizontal pager of the face,…\n\nruns: UI task, top screen of every idle frame; 1 Hz in AOD; none when OFF.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|7 gaps]]\n[[Home pager|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"sys-boot","type":"text","x":2784,"y":3356,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Boot screen**\nAbout 1.08 s start-up animation (43 frames…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). 40 Hz authored clock.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|2 gaps]]\n[[Boot screen|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
